  "paths": {
    "/relations/team/recommendations": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "球队智能推荐查询",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "球队智能推荐查询.\n\n <p>当数据中心球队已匹配 A 数据源球队、当前标签页 B 数据源球队未匹配时，前端调用本接口查询\n B 数据源下的推荐球队。接口只返回推荐结果；PRD 中“最近 10 场比赛、同开赛时间、同赛季、\n 同主客角色、统计出现次数”的描述是推荐算法说明，不单独提供上下文比赛接口。</p>\n\n <p>算法口径：</p>\n <ol>\n     <li>currentDataSource=1（纳米）时，以贝泰为基准源、纳米为目标源；</li>\n     <li>currentDataSource=3（贝泰）时，以纳米为基准源、贝泰为目标源；</li>\n     <li>currentDataSource=2（同兴）暂不参与推荐，返回成功和空列表；</li>\n     <li>取基准源球队最近 10 场足球比赛，按同开赛时间、同赛季、同主客角色统计目标源候选球队出现次数；</li>\n     <li>仅返回出现次数最高的候选球队，并按球队简称正序排列。</li>\n </ol>\n\n ```yaml\n errorCode:\n - 31: 服务异常\n - 2: teamId不能为空\n - 2: 当前数据源不存在\n - 2: 球队信息不存在\n ```",
        "operationId": "recommend",
        "tags": [
          "team-smart-recommendation-controller"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "currentDataSource",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Cookie",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "@CommonResult\\<List<TeamSmartRecommendationResponse>\\> 推荐候选球队列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommonResultListTeamSmartRecommendationResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    }
  },
